{"id":"9e1d47262e00c4b96772","title":"Civil Rights","url":"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights","original":"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/index.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T11:28:06.957Z","format":"html","sections":[{"title":"Reading","html":"\n      \n            \n\n\n      \n      \n    \n                        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n      \n                    \n  \n\n\n      \n            <div></div>\n\n            \n  \n\n                    \n\n\n\n\n        \n\n\n<h2>Civil Rights</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n\n  \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n      \n\n\n      \n                  \n\n\n  \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Civil Rights Information for Individuals and Advocates\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>We enforce laws against discrimination based on race, color, national origin, disability, age, sex, and religion by certain health care and human services providers and health insurance plans.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/for-individuals/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Filing a Civil Rights Complaint\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>You may file a civil rights complaint with OCR if you feel a health care provider or government agency discriminated against you (or someone else) unlawfully.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/filing-a-complaint/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          HIPAA - Health Information Privacy\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>Find guidance and more information about the HIPAA Privacy Rule, including what information is protected and how health information is used and disclosed.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n                        \n\n\n  \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Civil Rights for Providers of Health Care and Human Services\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>Understand which entities must comply with civil right laws and how to comply.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/for-providers/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>","id":"1"},{"title":"Newsroom","html":"\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Newsroom\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>Read the latest news releases and bulletins and an archive of past releases.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/newsroom/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Conscience and Religious Freedom\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>HHS enforces federal laws that protect conscience and the free exercise of religion and prohibit coercion and religious discrimination in health and human services.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/conscience/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n                        \n\n\n  \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Special Topics\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>Read about special topics in civil rights: Child welfare services, HIV/AIDS, limited English proficiency, community living and more.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/for-individuals/special-topics/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Office for Civil Rights\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>The Office for Civil Rights (OCR) ensures equal access to certain health and human services and protects the privacy and security of health information.</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/ocr/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n      \n                                                              <h2>\n                          Get Help in Other Languages\n                      </h2>\n              \n\n            \n              \n\n\n\n\n\n\n          <p>Español (Spanish), 繁體中文 (Chinese - Traditional), 简体中文 (Chinese – Simplified), Tiếng Việt (Vietnamese), 한국어 (Korean), Tagalog (Tagalog), Русский (Russian), العربية (Arabic), Français (French), Português (Portuguese), Kreyòl Ayisyen (French Creole), Polski (Polish), Italiano (Italian), Deutsch (German), 日本語 (Japanese), فارسی (Farsi)</p>\n    \n\n            \n      \n      \n            <div>\n\n                \n                  <a href=\"https://www.hhs.gov/ocr/get-help-in-other-languages/index.html\">learn more</a>\n        \n              </div>\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n                \n  \n    \n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n\n    \n\n                \n  \n  \n                \n    \n  \n      \n    ","id":"2"}],"textLength":1850,"sha256":"e7b44b64ad83539ad14b8d6f9775d8456b60bc89c8b902fc7954283868b5ac21","contentSha256":"0e32034e3d55a108278374c30a93626cb9954673d5579e6272f38668327923b7","textSha256":"046a6fd0bbcf75ef53188d6b9fd030078be5ce510b941230be545dfb7f5ca793","interactive":[],"attribution":"Source: U.S. Department of Health and Human Services. Public-domain federal text. Presented in the One DSD reading layout; original wording retained. Use does not imply endorsement by the source agency, HHS, or the U.S. Government.","licenseUrl":"https://www.copyright.gov/title17/92chap1.html#105","license":"public-domain","anchors":{}}